  "Specification": "A TLA+ specification of the Klotski sliding-block puzzle. Pieces are encoded as sets of positions on a 4x5 grid; the next-state relation slides a piece into an adjacent empty cell while ensuring no overlap with other pieces. KlotskiGoal expresses the puzzle's solved configuration as a state predicate, allowing TLC to find a solution by violating its negation.",
